&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The AI Teams at Agile Robots&lt;/strong&gt; are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Full-Stack Developer Intern (m/f/d) Robotics Data Collection&lt;/strong&gt;. Join our team in Munich, where you will help keep the software behind our robotics data-collection farm stable. We are seeking a hands-on student or recent graduate who has built and tested a full-stack web application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Farm Operations:&lt;/strong&gt; Diagnose failures in stations, releases, secrets, and data downloads, apply a safe fix, and document what happened so the next person does not start from zero.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bug Fixing:&lt;/strong&gt; Reproduce issues reported from the farm, trace them through the UI, API, and database, fix the root cause, and verify the fix on a running system.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Testing:&lt;/strong&gt; Add unit, API, and UI tests to new and existing features, write a test with every fix that would have caught the issue, and keep the tests reliable inside the regular test suite.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automation:&lt;/strong&gt; Automate the check or the fix itself when the same kind of issue keeps coming back.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Tooling:&lt;/strong&gt; Build small features and tools that make daily work easier for operators and engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering Workflow:&lt;/strong&gt; Work in small pull requests with clear descriptions and take review from a full-time engineer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Background:&lt;/strong&gt; Currently enrolled in, or recently graduated from, Computer Science, Software Engineering, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Debugging:&lt;/strong&gt; Reproduce a vague report such as “this screen is wrong”, trace it to the cause across frontend, backend, and database, and explain what you found.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full-Stack Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Coursework or personal projects with a React frontend and a Python backend, ideally FastAPI, that talks to a database.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Testing:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience writing unit, API, or UI tests that fail only when the behavior they check is broken.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Written Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Write bug tickets, pull request descriptions, and incident notes that stand on their own.&lt;/li&gt;
